# Book Map

A book map is not canon. It is an index and triage artifact.

## What this is

A public-safe discovery map for locating possible source cards, candidate canon touchpoints, and likely contradictions across the corpus. It uses paraphrase and chapter/section locators only. Reading it is not a substitute for reading the book.

## What this is not

Not canon. Not evidence. Not a substitute for the book. Not an advisory authority. It carries no claims that have been operator-approved beyond their status as map notes.

